# Agent tracing (mandatory)

For significant tasks:

1. Update [`.agents/AGENT_TRACER.md`](../../.agents/AGENT_TRACER.md) with a dated entry (agent, purpose, changes, notes).
2. For portal code changes, also update [`apps/portal/AGENT_TRACER.md`](../../apps/portal/AGENT_TRACER.md).
3. Leave `// AGENT-TRACE:` breadcrumbs at non-obvious integration points.

## Change index

Append one row to [`docs/REPO-CHANGE-INDEX.md`](../../docs/REPO-CHANGE-INDEX.md) before declaring done. `Docs updated: none` is a red flag unless truly doc-neutral.

## Knowledge base

Durable learnings belong in [`.agents/knowledge/`](../../.agents/knowledge/) — see [`README.md`](../../.agents/knowledge/README.md) for how to add or update skills.
